  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "地理資訊系統",
    "sub_ename": "GEOGRAPHIC INFORMATION SYSTEMS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程目標在介紹地理資訊系統（GIS）與空間資訊之理論、應用層面與軟體操作，為GIS基礎課程。理論部分包含空間資訊基本概念、空間資料與屬性資料建立、遙測與GPS應用等。課程實作內容包括數位圖建立、主題地圖製作、空間分析等。本課程同時為院必修核心課程，可依各系之需求規劃與專業相關之主題地圖製作與空間分析內容。",
    "describe_eh": "The goal of this course is to introduce the theory, application, and software operation of Geographic Information System (GIS) and spatial information, which is the basic course of GIS. The theoretical part includes the basic concepts of spatial information, the establishment of spatial data and attribute data, remote sensing and GPS applications, etc. The practical content of the course includes the establishment of digital maps, the production of thematic maps, spatial analysis, etc. This course is also a mandatory core course in the college, and the content of thematic map production and spatial analysis can be planned according to the needs of each department.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
